      "data": {
        "text": "**Selecting Cloud Vision AI**\n\nI've decided to proceed with Google Cloud Vision AI for text detection within the Python script. I want to make sure the user is able to easily identify this external provider in the code.\n\n\n**Choosing Implementation Details**\n\nI'm solidifying the implementation steps for `detect_image_text.py`. I'll import `google.cloud.vision`, define a function to receive an image, use the Vision AI client, and return the detected text. The user's code will clearly identify Google Cloud Vision AI.\n\n\n",
